<title>HUNGARY: TABLE: HUNGARY JUNE INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT UP 5.4 PCT.</title>
<headline>TABLE: HUNGARY JUNE INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT UP 5.4 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Statistical Office (KSH) gave the following output figures on Monday.</p>
<p>    HUNGARY INDUSTRY OUTPUT   June 97   May 97  June 96</p>
<p>    Monthly change (pct)	  +5.4     -1.6    -7.8</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change (pct)  +16.9     +1.7    -0.2</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom 361 327 4040</p>
</text>
